{
  "date": "2026-10-14",
  "pluginVersion": "0.3.0-alpha.13",
  "scope": "Registered tool catalog only; no execute() invocation or business API call",
  "tools": [
    {
      "name": "canvas_create",
      "timeoutMs": 90000,
      "description": "创建空画布并准备当前对话的画布服务，无需打开画布。名称可省略，默认新画布。只创建，不生成素材。created即已有真实画布ID；runtime:not_ready时保留该ID，待服务恢复后操作同画布，勿重建。create_unknown时先核对画布列表，不能自动重试。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "可选画布名称，1–100字符。"
          }
        }
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "canvas_get",
      "timeoutMs": 90000,
      "description": "读取已有画布，不打开画布。summary返回最多20个摘要，不能作写前版本依据；nodes返回节点正文/素材/参数、可信version和consistency，nodeIds省略时前20个；graph返回真实节点端口、允许输入类型及连线，outputs素材URL不是连线。graph的nodeOffset与edgeOffset独立分页，limit默认20；续页必须带第一页confirmed版本expectedVersion，版本变更时重新从第一页读取，勿混合不同版本。position有parentId时相对父组。普通写前和写后读取默认refresh:false，confirmed版本即可作写入依据，无需逐次重载。refresh:true仅用于明确要求的权威同步，或冲突/未知回执的恢复核对，会触发可见画布重载；unconfirmed或内容截断不能声称完整确认。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "canvasId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "正Long十进制字符串画布ID。"
          },
          "view": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "默认summary；写前使用nodes或graph的confirmed版本。",
            "enum": [
              "summary",
              "nodes",
              "graph"
            ]
          },
          "nodeIds": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "仅nodes可用，1–20个唯一节点ID；省略前20个。",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "refresh": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "仅nodes/graph可用；默认false，普通confirmed读取足够。true仅用于显式权威同步或冲突/未知回执恢复，会触发可见画布重载。"
          },
          "nodeOffset": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "仅graph，非负整数；续页带expectedVersion。"
          },
          "edgeOffset": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "仅graph，非负整数；续页带expectedVersion。"
          },
          "limit": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "仅graph，各节点/边页长度1–20整数，默认20。"
          },
          "expectedVersion": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "仅graph，第一页confirmed版本；任何offset大于0时必填。"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "canvasId"
        ]
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "canvas_node_edit",
      "timeoutMs": 90000,
      "description": "已有画布普通节点的保存操作，无需打开画布；action:add添加text/image/video/audio；update修改原节点的title/text/prompt/合法标量params；delete删除nodeIds及原生关联边；configure为普通image/video生成节点选择真实modelType/model和合法参数。上传/工具产物媒体只允许改标题或删除，不能改生成参数。严格按action提供一组字段：add仅node、update仅nodeId+changes、delete仅nodeIds、configure仅nodeId+configuration。不会执行生成/模板。默认自动放置，absolute仅精确位置，after只是坐标延展不建边。expectedVersion取最新confirmed读取或服务就绪created版本；普通读取已经足够，不需逐次refresh；冲突先重读，不覆盖。saved才是保存完成；submission_unknown保留真实ID，先权威读取，不能自动重复操作。error.retry仅说明恢复前提，不是自动重试许可；effect:none只表示未写入，不代表授权重试。用户要求失败停止时，参数校验失败或rejected也须停止，不换source、参数或调用继续尝试。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "canvasId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "已有画布ID，正Long十进制字符串。"
          },
          "expectedVersion": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "最新confirmed版本原样传入。"
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "add",
              "update",
              "delete",
              "configure"
            ]
          },
          "node": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "仅add，例如{\"type\":\"text\",\"changes\":{\"title\":\"测试文本\",\"text\":\"hello\"}}；title/text/prompt/params放在changes内，不是node根字段。",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "text",
                  "image",
                  "video",
                  "audio"
                ]
              },
              "placement": {
                "oneOf": [
                  {
                    "type": "object",
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "mode": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "const": "auto"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "mode"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "object",
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "mode": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "const": "absolute"
                      },
                      "position": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "additionalProperties": false,
                        "properties": {
                          "x": {
                            "type": "number"
                          },
                          "y": {
                            "type": "number"
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "x",
                          "y"
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "mode",
                      "position"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "object",
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "mode": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "const": "after"
                      },
                      "anchorNodeId": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "当前画布中的真实节点ID，最多100字符。"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "mode",
                      "anchorNodeId"
                    ]
                  }
                ],
                "description": "省略或auto由插件追加放置，不移动旧节点；absolute仅用户明确要求精确画布坐标时使用；after按指定节点的世界位置放在右侧，不建立连线，也不保证消除附近其他节点的重叠。"
              },
              "changes": {
                "type": "object",
                "description": "仅add的初始内容，title/text/prompt/params必须嵌套在node.changes内；省略用原生默认。",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "title": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "最多100字符，遵循原生命名规则。"
                  },
                  "text": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "仅文本节点正文，最多32768字符。"
                  },
                  "prompt": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "普通生成节点的提示词，最多32768字符，不触发生成。"
                  },
                  "params": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "description": "仅当前模型允许的标量技术参数；不能含model/modelType/prompt，不支持高级嵌套参数。",
                    "additionalProperties": true
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "type"
            ]
          },
          "nodeId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "仅update/configure，真实目标节点ID。"
          },
          "changes": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "仅update，至少一个变化字段；不会清空其他内容。",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "title": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "最多100字符，遵循原生命名规则。"
              },
              "text": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "仅文本节点正文，最多32768字符。"
              },
              "prompt": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "普通生成节点的提示词，最多32768字符，不触发生成。"
              },
              "params": {
                "type": "object",
                "description": "仅当前模型允许的标量技术参数；不能含model/modelType/prompt，不支持高级嵌套参数。",
                "additionalProperties": true
              }
            }
          },
          "nodeIds": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "仅delete，1–20个真实普通节点ID。删除会同时移除原生关联边。",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "configuration": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "仅configure，至少一个配置字段；先canvas_models读取当前账号可用值，不猜模型。",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "modelType": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "原生真实模式值，不使用中文展示名。"
              },
              "model": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "当前模式内可用的真实模型值。"
              },
              "params": {
                "type": "object",
                "description": "仅当前模型允许的标量技术参数；不能含model/modelType/prompt，不支持高级嵌套参数。",
                "additionalProperties": true
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "canvasId",
          "expectedVersion",
          "action"
        ]
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "canvas_edges",
      "timeoutMs": 90000,
      "description": "编辑真实画布连线并保存，不移动节点、不执行生成。add连接sourceNodeId/targetNodeId，端口省略时使用原生合法默认；delete删除edgeIds；reconnect用edgeId调整端点，保留原边ID；reorder对targetNodeId的全部入边提供完整edgeIds顺序，只调整该目标输入顺序。先canvas_get(view:graph)核对真实ID/端口/允许输入，不能把outputs素材URL当边。允许四类普通节点作为来源连接原生合法目标，包括已有工具的输入；禁止工具本体作为来源，禁止修改工具到产物的内部管理边；组不支持。expectedVersion取最新confirmed版本。saved才表示保存完成；submission_unknown先权威读取，不能自动重复写。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "canvasId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "已有画布ID，正Long十进制字符串。"
          },
          "expectedVersion": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "最新confirmed版本原样传入。"
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "add",
              "delete",
              "reconnect",
              "reorder"
            ]
          },
          "connection": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "仅add/reconnect；使用真实节点ID。",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "sourceNodeId": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "targetNodeId": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "sourceHandle": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "可选真实source端口ID，省略自动解析。"
              },
              "targetHandle": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "可选真实target端口ID，省略自动解析。"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "sourceNodeId",
              "targetNodeId"
            ]
          },
          "edgeId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "仅reconnect，已有真实边ID。"
          },
          "targetNodeId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "仅reorder，真实目标节点ID。"
          },
          "edgeIds": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "仅delete/reorder，1–20个唯一真实边ID；reorder必须包含目标全部入边。",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "canvasId",
          "expectedVersion",
          "action"
        ]
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "canvas_models",
      "timeoutMs": 90000,
      "description": "只读当前账号普通image/video生成节点的可用模式、模型与标量参数选项，不打开画布、不修改参数、不生成。modelType/model使用返回的value，勿猜或用label；省略时读取原生可用默认。modeOffset/modelOffset独立分页，limit默认20；任何offset大于0必须传第一页catalogVersion为expectedCatalogVersion，配置变更须重新读取，不混合不同配置页。通过canvas_node_edit(action:configure)保存配置；paramHints依据所选模型的默认父参数组合，不代表已有节点当前选择；configure后用canvas_get(view:nodes)查询该节点实时参数及选项。高级嵌套参数本期不开放。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "canvasId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "已有画布ID，正Long十进制字符串。"
          },
          "nodeType": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "image",
              "video"
            ]
          },
          "modelType": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "原生真实模式value；省略选原生可用默认。"
          },
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "当前模式内真实模型value；省略选原生可用默认。"
          },
          "modeOffset": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "非负整数；续页必须带expectedCatalogVersion。"
          },
          "modelOffset": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "非负整数；续页必须带expectedCatalogVersion。"
          },
          "limit": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "各模式/模型页长度1–20整数，默认20。"
          },
          "expectedCatalogVersion": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "第一页catalogVersion；任何offset大于0时必填。"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "canvasId",
          "nodeType"
        ]
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "canvas_assets",
      "timeoutMs": 90000,
      "description": "列出当前对话可见用户消息中的图片附件引用，供canvas_asset_import使用。不读取其他会话/本机路径，不上传/创建节点。列表按最近出现排序，最多20条；多图用途不明时询问绑定，不能猜。图片是Harness已归一化内容，可能缩尺寸/调整朝向，非原文件字节；文件附件/被压缩移除的旧图片需用户重新提供图片或指定已有画布图片节点。",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {}
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
